<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5080] SecurityBasicPermissionSet implementation is incomplete</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5080</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;There are several issues with &lt;tt&gt;SecurityBasicPermissionSet&lt;/tt&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;It doesn&apos;t implement &lt;tt&gt;hashCode&lt;/tt&gt; and &lt;tt&gt;equals&lt;/tt&gt; methods. This makes it impossible to use it as part of validation token.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;Collection&lt;/tt&gt; fields are not marked with &lt;tt&gt;@GridToStringInclude&lt;/tt&gt; annotation, so &lt;tt&gt;toString&lt;/tt&gt; method doesn&apos;t actually print out all the information.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;&lt;tt&gt;systemPermissions&lt;/tt&gt; method returns empty collection instead of &lt;tt&gt;null&lt;/tt&gt; by default. This actually means &apos;no system permissions&apos; even if &lt;tt&gt;defaultAllowAll&lt;/tt&gt; is true.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
</description>
